  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Thaw phyllo dough according to package instructions.",
    "Cut phyllo into 4 equal pieces.",
    "Brush each piece of phyllo with butter.",
    "Place a tablespoon of roasted turkish vegetable mix on one half of each phyllo piece.",
    "Sprinkle with feta cheese and parsley.",
    "Fold the other half of phyllo over the filling.",
    "Brush the tops of the borek with beaten egg.",
    "Place the borek on a baking sheet and bake for 20-25 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
